      "oneLiner": {
        "zh": "符号 AI 靠规则推理找解；搜索就是按规则把未来的局面画成一棵树去找目标；有对手时用 minimax（我们取最大、对手取最小）；树太大就用启发式估分，但会失去保证；最后讨论奖励要和人类价值观“对齐”。",
        "en": "Symbolic AI finds solutions by reasoning with rules; Search looks ahead through a state tree to find a goal, Minimax handles an opponent, heuristics estimate values when the tree is too big, and Alignment asks whether the reward matches human values."
      },
      "estimatedMinutes": 140,
      "questionCount": 48,
      "termCount": 48
    },
